UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text5_0` = '王子又讲过灰烬使者的故事了吗？那是我们最喜欢的故事。他最喜欢的则是灰烬使者的续篇。当然，从没有人能让他讲出那个故事。' WHERE `ID` = 6911 AND `text5_0` = 'Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text5_1` = '王子又讲过灰烬使者的故事了吗？那是我们最喜欢的故事。他最喜欢的则是灰烬使者的续篇。当然，从没有人能让他讲出那个故事。' WHERE `ID` = 6911 AND `text5_1` = 'Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.';
