UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text4_1` = '出门千万别忘了带足够的闪光粉，和别人一起干活时更是如此。我保证每次都有人用光。$B$B当要在分发材料和让那可怜虫去死之间做选择时，我会帮忙……大多数时候。' WHERE `ID` = 10686 AND `text4_1` = 'Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.$B$BWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time.';
